   "text": "Bram takes 2 from the pile (pile now 9).",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002235",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Roan takes 2 from the pile (pile now 7).",
   "who": "Roan",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002236",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Dav takes 2 from the pile (pile now 5).",
   "who": "Dav",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002237",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Taric takes 2 from the pile (pile now 3).",
   "who": "Taric",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002238",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Esa takes 2 from the pile (pile now 1).",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002239",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Vela takes 1 from the pile (pile now 0).",
   "who": "Vela",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002287",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Dav gives 1 food to Ryn.",
   "who": "Dav",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002288",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Vela gives 1 food to Bram.",
   "who": "Vela",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002295",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Dell gives 1 food to Ryn.",
   "who": "Dell",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002300",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Vela gives 1 food to Bram.",
   "who": "Vela",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002302",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Taric gives 1 food to Kael.",
   "who": "Taric",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002305",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Kael gathers Vela, Esa, Ryn, Roan to talk.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002306",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Vela, I watched you pull three times for Bram this round and I need to hear from your own mouth what you think that buys you \u2014 because this circle kept you fed and safe for five years, and I'm not going to watch that get traded away to a man who's been circling us like a creditor.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002307",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Kael's right to ask it, and Vela owes this room an answer \u2014 but I'll say what I'm watching while we wait for it: Bram's got four food and Mako's sitting on six and neither of them has said a word to anyone today, which means this circle needs to be pulling the same direction before one of those two decides the quiet is over. Vela, I'm not your enemy in this room, but three times is a pattern and patterns get named.",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002308",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Vela, I've asked it gentle and I've asked it plain and Esa's backed me both times, so I'll ask it one last way: if Bram's got something on you \u2014 a debt, a promise, a threat \u2014 say it now and this circle helps you carry it, because three gifts to the same man in a single day isn't loyalty, it's a leash, and I want to know whose hand is holding the other end.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002309",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Vela, I've watched you five years and I know you don't give without a reason \u2014 so give us the reason now, because what Kael just offered you is the best deal in this room: say the thing and we carry it with you, or stay silent and carry it alone while we start wondering what else you haven't said.",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002310",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Vela, the room's gone quiet and that silence is the last thing standing between you and us deciding you've already made your choice \u2014 so I'll say it one final time and I'll mean every word: Bram is not your family, he is not your blood, and whatever he offered you isn't worth what you'll lose here when Mako finally moves and you're standing on the wrong side of it.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002311",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Vela, I've got a son in this village and I've got three food between me and the ground, so I'm going to be shorter than Kael: tell us what Bram said to you, or when he moves on one of us, we move on him without checking where you're standing first.",
   "who": "Roan",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002312",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Vela, Roan just put the floor under you and I'm not going to add another word to it \u2014 I'm going to watch your face and wait, because everything you say from here is the truth of what the last five years meant to you.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002313",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Vela, the silence is your answer and I've heard it \u2014 so I'm going to say what nobody else has said yet: if Bram's got you feeding him because you're fifty and you think he's the only one in this village who'll keep you alive past the years a woman can bear children, then name that fear out loud, because I'd rather know it than watch you disappear into his circle one food at a time.",
   "who": "Roan",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002314",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Roan named the one thing I've been waiting for someone to say \u2014 Vela's fifty, same age as me, and the years a woman can bear children are behind her, which means Bram isn't offering her protection, he's offering her the feeling of it, and that's a much cheaper thing to buy. Vela, I don't need you to be ashamed of wanting to survive \u2014 I need you to understand that Bram's price goes up every time you pay it, and this circle's price stays fixed.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
