  {
   "eid": "e002408",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Kael gathers Vela, Esa, Ryn, Roan to talk.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002409",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Vela, Zinn just arrived from Sela and Mako's blood, which means Mako's already planted two roots in this circle \u2014 first Sela, now a child \u2014 and Bram knows it, which is exactly why he's been keeping you warm and grateful. You want to survive past fifty, so do I, and I'm not going to lie to you about the math: you've got more years in you than Bram is counting on, but only if the people standing next to you when he finally moves aren't the ones you've been feeding him with.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002410",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Kael's said the hard thing, so I'll say the soft one: Vela, I'm not asking you to cut Bram cold overnight, because a sudden change reads as guilt and guilt draws attention \u2014 I'm asking you to slow the giving, let him wonder, and let this circle remind you what five years of real standing is worth before you hand it to a man who's only been counting since year one.",
   "who": "Roan",
   "year": 6
  },
