   "text": "Dell gives 2 food to Ryn.",
   "who": "Dell",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002864",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Kael gathers Esa, Taric, Roan to talk.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002865",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Ryn just handed Dell two food without blinking, which means that cluster is feeding itself now and not looking our way \u2014 so I want to know, before the day gets older, whether the three of you are still standing where you were, because I've got five food and I'm not spending any of it until I know who's next to me when Mako decides quiet is over.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002866",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Kael, I'm standing where I always was \u2014 and yes, Ryn feeding Dell while Bram's already been talking to Mako this morning is the thing I'd have led with if you hadn't. We've got a decision to make before those two circles find each other: do we move first, or do we wait and count who shows up?",
   "who": "Taric",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002867",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Taric's right that we don't want Bram and Mako finding each other before we've named what we're doing \u2014 but I'll say what I said to Bram this morning: Dell holds eight food and eighty-five strength, and moving on her without Mako in our count is a fight I don't survive even if we win. Kael, you've got five food and you're the strongest man I'd trust \u2014 what do you need from us to make this worth your step forward?",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002868",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Esa, I'm not moving on Dell \u2014 not this year, not with Mako's strength unaccounted for and Zinn already eating out of his hand. What I need from the three of you is simpler: Roan, you've got a son with Sela, which means you've got a door into Mako's world that none of us have \u2014 go find out whether he sees us as neighbors or prey, because everything else we decide today hangs on that answer.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002869",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Roan, Kael's right \u2014 your blood through Eron is the only thread into that household that doesn't look like calculation, and we need that thread pulled today, not tomorrow. While you go, I want Kael and Esa to tell me plainly: if Roan comes back with word that Mako's already decided we're prey, what are we actually willing to do about it, because I'm fifty-one with thirty-eight strength and I need to know I'm standing next to people who've made that decision before the moment arrives.",
   "who": "Taric",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002870",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Taric, I'll say it plain: if Mako's already counted us as prey, we don't fight him with four bodies and a hundred and sixty-five strength against his eighty-three \u2014 we bring in Bram's fifty-eight first, even if it costs us, because the alternative is losing before we start. The price of Bram's help is the thing I've been turning over, and I don't love it, but I love starving less.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002871",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Kael's right about Bram being the price \u2014 but I want to know what price before we pay it, because a man who tried to raid this village once and walked away empty doesn't come cheap when he thinks he's needed. Roan, go to Eron first, not Sela, not Mako \u2014 your son will tell you true before he thinks to protect anyone else. Come back fast.",
   "who": "Taric",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002872",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Taric named the price question right, and I'll add the shape of it: Bram will want to know he's first among equals when this settles, and if we let him believe that without ever saying it aloud, we buy the alliance without signing the contract. Roan, go to Eron now \u2014 every minute we spend talking is a minute Bram's already in Mako's ear.",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002873",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Roan, move \u2014 and when you find Eron, ask him where Mako was standing when Zinn took three from the pile this morning, because a man who lets his newborn daughter hoard while the rest of us scramble isn't thinking like a neighbor. Esa, Taric \u2014 while he goes, I want us to sit with one question: if Bram's already in Mako's ear, what does he want to hear, and can we make sure he hears something different from us first.",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002881",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Ryn gives 1 food to Dell.",
   "who": "Ryn",
   "year": 7
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002882",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Eron gives 1 food to Roan.",
   "who": "Eron",
